          "body": "+1 This sounds like a great way to approach flexible indexing: incrementally.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=cutting",
            "name": "cutting",
            "key": "cutting",
            "avatarUrls": {
